  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Can an AI Agent stay on track across context windows? Use a handoff.",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 4.92,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.16,
      "spokenEnd": 4.28,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic studied this problem in a long-running coding setup.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 4.28,
      "spokenStart": 4.44,
      "spokenEnd": 6.911,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Their useful conclusion is simple: do not ask a fresh session to rediscover the whole project before it can help.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.376,
      "audioStart": 6.856,
      "spokenStart": 7.011,
      "spokenEnd": 11.609,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Without a working floor, an Agent can restart by guessing, repeat already-finished work, or mistake a half-built feature for a completed task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.224,
      "audioStart": 11.609,
      "spokenStart": 11.769,
      "spokenEnd": 18.189,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "That burns time and quietly raises risk.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.712,
      "audioStart": 18.136,
      "spokenStart": 18.289,
      "spokenEnd": 20.205,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The reusable tool in this episode is a Long-Running AI Agent Progress & Handoff Card.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.656,
      "audioStart": 20.207,
      "spokenStart": 20.365,
      "spokenEnd": 24.218,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It turns a vague continuation request into a small, inspectable next move.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.32,
      "audioStart": 24.157,
      "spokenStart": 24.318,
      "spokenEnd": 27.812,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "We will separate the reset problem, the minimum starting state, the size of a good next move, the handoff itself, and the evidence required before progress is claimed.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.208,
      "audioStart": 27.815,
      "spokenStart": 27.972,
      "spokenEnd": 35.365,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This video is packed with practical, high-value insights to help you get better at using AI.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.704,
      "audioStart": 35.37,
      "spokenStart": 35.525,
      "spokenEnd": 39.401,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It's a longer one, so follow Tiny Agent and save it so you don't lose it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.984,
      "audioStart": 39.351,
      "spokenStart": 39.501,
      "spokenEnd": 42.692,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A long task does not become continuous just because the Agent has a loop.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.792,
      "audioStart": 42.72,
      "spokenStart": 42.872,
      "spokenEnd": 45.85,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Each context window is a new session with incomplete memory of what happened before.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.224,
      "audioStart": 45.802,
      "spokenStart": 45.95,
      "spokenEnd": 49.372,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "That reset creates two costly failure modes.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3,
      "audioStart": 49.38,
      "spokenStart": 49.532,
      "spokenEnd": 51.726,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The Agent can attempt too much at once, or it can see partial progress and declare the entire job finished.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.304,
      "audioStart": 51.671,
      "spokenStart": 51.826,
      "spokenEnd": 56.33,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Compaction can preserve some context, but it is not a substitute for a durable work state.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.632,
      "audioStart": 56.339,
      "spokenStart": 56.49,
      "spokenEnd": 60.333,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A new session still needs to know what matters now.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.856,
      "audioStart": 60.282,
      "spokenStart": 60.433,
      "spokenEnd": 62.508,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Treat the handoff as an interface, not as a diary.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 62.514,
      "spokenStart": 62.668,
      "spokenEnd": 64.937,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It should help the next Agent choose a safe next action without rereading every past conversation.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.704,
      "audioStart": 64.878,
      "spokenStart": 65.037,
      "spokenEnd": 68.916,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Do not ask what the last session discussed.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.568,
      "audioStart": 68.92,
      "spokenStart": 69.076,
      "spokenEnd": 70.834,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Ask what is true in the environment, what remains unproven, and what should happen next.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.44,
      "audioStart": 70.778,
      "spokenStart": 70.934,
      "spokenEnd": 74.579,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A reset becomes manageable when the project keeps a small source of truth outside the context window.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.968,
      "audioStart": 74.576,
      "spokenStart": 74.739,
      "spokenEnd": 78.889,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 78.902,
      "spokenStart": 79.049,
      "spokenEnd": 79.821,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, a context window reset can erase practical working state.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 79.77,
      "spokenStart": 79.921,
      "spokenEnd": 82.987,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, partial work can trigger either repeated effort or premature completion.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.248,
      "audioStart": 82.98,
      "spokenStart": 83.147,
      "spokenEnd": 86.564,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, the next session needs an actionable state, not a transcript.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 86.567,
      "spokenStart": 86.724,
      "spokenEnd": 89.771,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Start with a working floor before asking an AI Agent to add a feature.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 3.984,
      "audioStart": 89.783,
      "spokenStart": 89.951,
      "spokenEnd": 93.072,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The floor is the smallest verified state from which new work is safe.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.648,
      "audioStart": 93.023,
      "spokenStart": 93.172,
      "spokenEnd": 96.02,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "For software work, that usually includes a runnable environment, a feature list, a progress record, and a quick end-to-end check.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.696,
      "audioStart": 96.022,
      "spokenStart": 96.18,
      "spokenEnd": 102.064,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Other domains need equivalent anchors.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.4,
      "audioStart": 102,
      "spokenStart": 102.164,
      "spokenEnd": 103.761,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The initializer has a distinct job: make future sessions less dependent on inference.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.464,
      "audioStart": 103.749,
      "spokenStart": 103.921,
      "spokenEnd": 107.579,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It prepares the map before anyone starts driving.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.856,
      "audioStart": 107.517,
      "spokenStart": 107.679,
      "spokenEnd": 109.748,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Keep requirements in a structure that makes completion visible.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.144,
      "audioStart": 109.748,
      "spokenStart": 109.908,
      "spokenEnd": 112.21,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A feature is not complete because it sounds finished;",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.88,
      "audioStart": 112.154,
      "spokenStart": 112.31,
      "spokenEnd": 114.388,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u03",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 2,
      "text": "it is complete when its observable behavior passes.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.952,
      "audioStart": 114.326,
      "spokenStart": 114.488,
      "spokenEnd": 116.63,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Also record the current constraints: accepted inputs, forbidden changes, known failures, and the evidence a reviewer will need.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.768,
      "audioStart": 116.626,
      "spokenStart": 116.79,
      "spokenEnd": 122.752,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A stable floor reduces the temptation to rebuild the foundation in every session.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.296,
      "audioStart": 122.75,
      "spokenStart": 122.912,
      "spokenEnd": 126.368,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 126.381,
      "spokenStart": 126.528,
      "spokenEnd": 127.3,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, create a minimal verified starting environment.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.216,
      "audioStart": 127.237,
      "spokenStart": 127.4,
      "spokenEnd": 129.81,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, make requirements and current constraints easy to inspect.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.696,
      "audioStart": 129.813,
      "spokenStart": 129.97,
      "spokenEnd": 132.851,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, treat the initializer as setup for future sessions, not as one-shot delivery.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.728,
      "audioStart": 132.852,
      "spokenStart": 133.011,
      "spokenEnd": 136.928,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Once the floor exists, shrink the next move.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.952,
      "audioStart": 136.958,
      "spokenStart": 137.108,
      "spokenEnd": 139.27,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A long-running AI Agent should advance one meaningful unit instead of trying to finish the whole project in one pass.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.544,
      "audioStart": 139.207,
      "spokenStart": 139.37,
      "spokenEnd": 144.107,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Choose a unit that has a clear boundary: one feature, one failure to reproduce, one data check, or one reviewable decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.72,
      "audioStart": 144.117,
      "spokenStart": 144.267,
      "spokenEnd": 150.183,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It should fit inside the available context.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.664,
      "audioStart": 150.125,
      "spokenStart": 150.283,
      "spokenEnd": 152.157,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A small move still needs a result.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.328,
      "audioStart": 152.162,
      "spokenStart": 152.317,
      "spokenEnd": 153.849,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The Agent should change a real state, run the relevant verification, and say what that verification did and did not prove.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.88,
      "audioStart": 153.775,
      "spokenStart": 153.949,
      "spokenEnd": 159.013,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This is not slow for its own sake.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.376,
      "audioStart": 159.02,
      "spokenStart": 159.173,
      "spokenEnd": 160.739,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Small completed units avoid the expensive recovery work caused by abandoned half-implementations.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.968,
      "audioStart": 160.675,
      "spokenStart": 160.839,
      "spokenEnd": 164.979,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "When a request is too large, split by a user-observable outcome rather than by arbitrary files or token counts.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.784,
      "audioStart": 164.969,
      "spokenStart": 165.139,
      "spokenEnd": 170.107,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The progress card should name one next move, its success signal, and its stop condition.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.656,
      "audioStart": 170.117,
      "spokenStart": 170.267,
      "spokenEnd": 174.091,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.56,
      "audioStart": 174.104,
      "spokenStart": 174.251,
      "spokenEnd": 175.015,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, give each session one bounded meaningful objective.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 174.96,
      "spokenStart": 175.115,
      "spokenEnd": 177.728,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, connect that objective to a real verification signal.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.576,
      "audioStart": 177.731,
      "spokenStart": 177.888,
      "spokenEnd": 180.636,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, split oversized work by observable outcome, not by convenience.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 180.636,
      "spokenStart": 180.796,
      "spokenEnd": 184.418,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A useful handoff answers four questions fast: what changed, what is verified, what is uncertain, and what is the next smallest safe action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 7.296,
      "audioStart": 184.435,
      "spokenStart": 184.598,
      "spokenEnd": 191.07,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Write decisions and evidence beside each other.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 191.07,
      "spokenStart": 191.23,
      "spokenEnd": 193.083,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A choice is usable when it names the browser evidence that passed and the alternative that failed.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.488,
      "audioStart": 193.031,
      "spokenStart": 193.183,
      "spokenEnd": 196.863,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Leave paths to the source of truth, not a copied wall of context.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.84,
      "audioStart": 196.875,
      "spokenStart": 197.023,
      "spokenEnd": 200.07,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The next Agent can inspect the feature list, progress note, tests, or artifacts on demand.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.112,
      "audioStart": 200.011,
      "spokenStart": 200.17,
      "spokenEnd": 204.487,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Keep the environment clean enough for another person or Agent to begin immediately.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.888,
      "audioStart": 204.488,
      "spokenStart": 204.647,
      "spokenEnd": 207.704,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Hidden breakage is not progress merely because a diff exists.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.36,
      "audioStart": 207.649,
      "spokenStart": 207.804,
      "spokenEnd": 210.376,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "A good handoff also names a boundary: do not change this integration, do not claim this metric, or wait for this external approval.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.768,
      "audioStart": 210.373,
      "spokenStart": 210.536,
      "spokenEnd": 216.47,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "That boundary is how you preserve human judgment when the Agent continues independently.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.128,
      "audioStart": 216.474,
      "spokenStart": 216.63,
      "spokenEnd": 219.955,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 219.968,
      "spokenStart": 220.115,
      "spokenEnd": 220.887,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, record changes, evidence, uncertainty, and the next move.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.344,
      "audioStart": 220.832,
      "spokenStart": 220.987,
      "spokenEnd": 224.538,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, link to inspectable sources instead of copying all context.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.128,
      "audioStart": 224.536,
      "spokenStart": 224.698,
      "spokenEnd": 227.998,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, make constraints explicit so the next Agent does not overreach.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 227.995,
      "spokenStart": 228.158,
      "spokenEnd": 231.208,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Before an AI Agent marks progress complete, verify the claimed outcome at the level the user will experience.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.688,
      "audioStart": 231.212,
      "spokenStart": 231.388,
      "spokenEnd": 236.256,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A unit test alone may not prove an end-to-end feature works.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 236.196,
      "spokenStart": 236.356,
      "spokenEnd": 239.047,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The source article describes better results when Agents were explicitly prompted to use browser automation for end-to-end checks in a web-app setting.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 239.038,
      "spokenStart": 239.207,
      "spokenEnd": 244.829,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Use the narrowest sufficient check first, then add a realistic workflow check when the claim affects an interface, integration, or delivery.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.672,
      "audioStart": 244.835,
      "spokenStart": 244.989,
      "spokenEnd": 250.84,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Update the progress card only after the evidence exists.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 250.837,
      "spokenStart": 251,
      "spokenEnd": 253.463,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A pass flag is an output of verification, not a substitute for it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 253.403,
      "spokenStart": 253.563,
      "spokenEnd": 256.616,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "When verification fails, preserve the failure, the reproduction path, and the smallest next diagnostic step.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.952,
      "audioStart": 256.62,
      "spokenStart": 256.776,
      "spokenEnd": 261.916,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "That turns a reset into a focused continuation.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.952,
      "audioStart": 261.861,
      "spokenStart": 262.016,
      "spokenEnd": 264.17,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This is also the human gate: people decide whether the evidence is enough for the consequence at stake.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.872,
      "audioStart": 264.175,
      "spokenStart": 264.33,
      "spokenEnd": 268.409,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 268.422,
      "spokenStart": 268.569,
      "spokenEnd": 269.336,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, verify outcomes at the level users actually experience.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.888,
      "audioStart": 269.281,
      "spokenStart": 269.436,
      "spokenEnd": 272.494,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, record evidence before changing a task to complete.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 272.497,
      "spokenStart": 272.654,
      "spokenEnd": 275.335,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, turn failures into precise next diagnostics rather than vague retries.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.536,
      "audioStart": 275.334,
      "spokenStart": 275.495,
      "spokenEnd": 279.234,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Long-running AI Agents need continuity by design, not by optimism.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.248,
      "audioStart": 279.258,
      "spokenStart": 279.414,
      "spokenEnd": 282.835,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "First, establish a working floor with a runnable environment, clear requirements, and a fast reality check.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.688,
      "audioStart": 282.839,
      "spokenStart": 282.995,
      "spokenEnd": 287.869,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, make one bounded move at a time and verify its observable result.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.224,
      "audioStart": 287.872,
      "spokenStart": 288.029,
      "spokenEnd": 291.445,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, leave a handoff that states changes, evidence, uncertainty, boundaries, and the next safe action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.048,
      "audioStart": 291.457,
      "spokenStart": 291.605,
      "spokenEnd": 296.863,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Use the Long-Running AI Agent Progress & Handoff Card whenever work must cross sessions, people, or context windows.",
